ic  rotting smell erica hides under a bed  sheet and as soon as aki removes it  we're welcomed by yet another horrifying  sight from a beautiful looking young  girl erica's been transferred into this  ugly as sin extremely gassy ogre she  crawls towards aki and grabs her leg  just how aki grabbed hers during the  spider shark attack and just like erica  before her aki kicks her in the face  during this she starts spewing hate  stemming from her deep-rooted  insecurities about her looks she starts  showing her true colors her loathing of  her supposed friend erica and gary after  hearing this erica attacks it's a  scuffle and in the end aki hits her with  a freaking ashtray and leaves back to  karina they're closer to where that she  is but personnel dressed in ppe suits  have quarantined the area they  mercilessly push back our girl gary as  she desperately tries to get through  there's utter chaos on the streets as  people start looting robbing and killing  each other parallel to this the war with  the creatures is in full throttle  elsewhere shiragama and gary decide to  rest in a safe place to figure out their  next move they see an online broadcast  of people turning into ogre-like  creatures like erika it's due to a  bacterial infection they watch tadashi's  uncle giving his expert opinion on the  issue seeing that gary and shirakama  decide to visit him on the way there we  get a glimpse of our first spider humans  or rather spider ogres we should say  erika's turned into one too she's not  dead she's chasing aki the chase comes  to an end with aki falling into a pit  filled with small spider fish shirakawa  and gary reach tadashi's uncle's place  no one's there but gary notices  dadashi's shoes at the entrance and  frantically starts looking for him  before we go further let's take a moment  to look at this painting at tadashi's  uncle's place  who hangs up [ __ ] trash like this  anyway shirakawa finds a recent research  file on a computer there lo and behol